	month = {AUG 13},
	abstract = {This paper presents a comparison between the modal identification method
   (MIM) and the proper orthogonal decomposition-Galerkin (POD-G) method
   for model reduction. An example of application on a nonlinear diffusive
   system is used to illustrate the study. The study shows that in both
